<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>FL2024_exam 45</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; }
h1 { color: #C0392B; font-size: 20pt; }
h2 { color: #1F618D; font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 24px; }
.qtext { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px; white-space: pre-wrap; }
.opt { margin: 4px 0 4px 20px; }
.correct { color: green; font-weight: bold; }
.selectedwrong { color: red; font-weight: bold; }
.selectedright { color: green; font-weight: bold; }
.explain { background: #F4F6F6; padding: 8px; margin-top: 8px; font-style: italic; }
.video { margin-top:6px; }
img { max-width: 500px; margin: 10px 0; display:block; }
</style></head><body><h1>FL2024_EXAM 45 - Ket qua &amp; giai thich</h1><p><b>Ho ten:</b> Hang Tran<br/><b>Ket qua:</b> 8/31<br/><b>Thoi gian lam bai:</b> 13 phút 21 giây<br/><b>Nop bai:</b> 2026-08-03T08:29:37.375Z</p><hr/><h2>Cau hoi 1</h2><div class="qtext">Why is the "Three Amigos" approach considered beneficial in Agile software development?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. Because it reduces the number of team members needed to complete a sprint [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. Because it delays detailed discussions until after development is complete</div><div class="opt correct">c. Because it ensures a collaborative understanding of requirements between business, development, and testing roles [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">d. Because it allows the development team to work independently without interruptions</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> refer 4.5 phần User Story có nói Three amigo = collaborative</div><h2>Cau hoi 2</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following statements is correct about DevOps?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. It helps organizations improve website quality and stability by releasing website features more frequently [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. It helps organizations deliver web content to different types of devices using web applications.</div><div class="opt ">c. It offers a lifecycle that consists of a series of iterative, automated development processes called workflows.</div><div class="opt correct">d. It’s an approach to deployment that promotes collaboration between the website, website development, and IT teams in a business. [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 2.1.4 về DevOps thì chọn cái promotes collaboration là phù hợp với hướng tiếp cận của DevOps và Agile</div><h2>Cau hoi 3</h2><div class="qtext">You are testing the functional behavior of an elevator in a building with 10 floors. The elevator has buttons for each floor, and it responds to both internal (inside the elevator) and external (on each floor) button presses. Which of the following test design techniques is MOST appropriate to test the functional behavior of the elevator?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. Boundary Value Analysis [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt correct">b. State Transition Testing [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">c. Use Case Testing</div><div class="opt ">d. Statement Coverage</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 4.2 Đề chỉ bảo test chức năng của cái elevator là cái thang máy ( embedded software) nên kỹ thuật phù hợp là state transition</div><h2>Cau hoi 4</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following is a purpose of a pilot project for the introduction of a new tool?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. Evaluate testers competence to use the tool. [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. Complete the testing of a key project.</div><div class="opt ">c. Discover what the requirements for the tool are.</div><div class="opt correct">d. Assess whether the benefits will be achieved at reasonable cost. [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 6.3 mục tiêu của pilot project</div><h2>Cau hoi 5</h2><div class="qtext">What is the benefit of using lightweight test documentation?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. It provides exhaustive details for every test case. [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt correct">b. It reduces the overhead of maintaining test documents while ensuring essential information is captured. [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">c. It eliminates the need for any communication within the team.</div><div class="opt ">d. It strictly follows ISO standards without room for flexibility.</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Chapter 4. Lightweight giống như high level Test case, nói về việc làm tài liệu test ngắn gọn và nhẹ nhàng thì giúp điều gì? Chọn B vì dịch như sau: nó giúp giảm công sức maintaining các tài liệu này trong khi vẫn đảm bảo thông tin quan trọng đc capture</div><h2>Cau hoi 6</h2><div class="qtext">How are role personas used in designing tests?</div><div class="opt selectedright">a. To simulate the behavior and needs of different user types during testing. [BAN DA CHON - DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">b. To document defect reports with user details.</div><div class="opt ">c. To prioritize test cases based on code coverage.</div><div class="opt ">d. To automate repetitive test steps</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Vai trò của cá nhân trong việc thiết kế test case, Ý nói là suy nghĩ và tiếng nói của mỗi cá nhân sẽ khác nhau như vậy nó đại diện cho các quan điểm của các user khác nhau khi đưa ra TC, chon A.</div><h2>Cau hoi 7</h2><div class="qtext">What is one potential benefit of using a test automation tool?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. The quality of defects will improve [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt correct">b. B. Ease of access to statistics about test progress [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Disk space is not required to track versions of test artifacts</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Less network traffic generated</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 6.2 Lợi ích của automation tool? Benefit: Reduce time, reduce repetitive task, Assessment objectively, easier access inf, có them thời gian cho tester. Prevent human errors Chọn B.</div><h2>Cau hoi 8</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following is a benefit of early stakeholder feedback?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. It can be gathered early and then used to make changes after the product goes to production to make it more user friendly [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. It allows the project manager to get a better view of the changes that will be needed for the next version</div><div class="opt correct">c. C. The developers get a better understanding of what they are building [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">d. D. The testers get a better understanding of the test automation requirements</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 3.2.1. Benefits of Early and Frequent Stakeholder Feedback. Lợi ích của phản hồi sớm, A sai vì 'changes after the product goes to production' là thay đổi đc tạo ra sau khi sản phẩm lên production là quá muộn, tương tự B sai vì quá muộn "changes that will be needed for the next version" next version cũng là lần release sau rồi. B đúng vì "a better understanding" hiểu biết về cái gì cần phải xây dựng tốt hơn. C sai vì "test automation requirements" yêu cầu về test automation thì là trách nhiệm của tester rồi, ko liên quan đến stakeholder feedback</div><h2>Cau hoi 9</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following is a good testing practice that applies regardless of the specific software development lifecycle being used?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. Prompt and prepared attendance to stand-up meetings [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. Step-by-step test case documentation</div><div class="opt correct">c. C. Ensuring there is a corresponding testing activity for every software development activity [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Involving the stakeholders in reviewing all acceptance criteria prior to designing test cases</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 2.1.2. good testing practices. Chọn C đúng như sách</div><h2>Cau hoi 10</h2><div class="qtext">In an Agile development model, the completion of testing or “done” is defined by which of the following?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. Project management [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. Entry criteria</div><div class="opt correct">c. C. Exit criteria [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">d. D. The expected test completion date</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 5.1.3. Entry Criteria and Exit Criteria. thì Definition of done = exit criteria nên chọn C</div><h2>Cau hoi 11</h2><div class="qtext">You are testing web application software that allows a person to use their travel points to make flight and hotel reservations. When the user logs into the software (username/password) they are presented with a set of options. From that set of options, they can pick the following: 1. View points balance 2. Make flight reservation 3. Make hotel reservation From the login page, they can log in successfully or might fail and need to try again. Once they login successfully they can go to either the view points, flight reservation or hotel reservation page. Which of the following is the correct list of the transitions (a transition is shown as &gt;) that should be tested, assuming that the test ends when a reservation state is reached.</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. Points &gt; Reservation [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. Login &gt; Points, Points &gt; Flight, Points &gt; Hotel</div><div class="opt correct">c. C. Login &gt; Login, Login &gt; Points, Login &gt; Flight, Login &gt; Hotel, Points &gt; Flight, Points &gt; Hotel [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Login &gt; Login, Login &gt; Points, Login &gt; Flight, Login &gt; Hotel, Flight &gt; Hotel, Hotel &gt; Flight, Flight &gt; Login, Hotel &gt; Login</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 4.2.4 State transition testing. Vẽ sơ đồ ra, Hỏi là sơ đồ transitions nào đúng thứ tự đi từ đầu đến khi kết thúc là phải đặt đc máy bay hoặc khách sạn?</div><h2>Cau hoi 12</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following is an advantage of the whole team approach?</div><div class="opt selectedright">a. A. Any person in the team with the right skills can perform any task [BAN DA CHON - DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. Tasks are assigned to specific team members who will own that task until completion</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Testers have clear ownership of quality and this eliminates confusion and overlap</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Business representatives are not included in the team so they can supply independent assessment during UAT</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 1.5.2. Whole Team Approach. Ta thấy A đúng như sách luôn. B sai vì nó nói 1 task sẽ assign cho 1 member cụ thể làm cho đến khi hoàn thành, C sai vì nó nói về việc tester chịu trách nhiệm toàn bộ về quality. D thì bảo là BA ko bao gồm trong team. Nói chung Whole team approach là đang nói về cả dự án là 1 team và có trách nhiệm như nhau về chất lượng, bất kỳ ai cũng có kỹ năng để làm bất kỳ task nào</div><h2>Cau hoi 13</h2><div class="qtext">If you are using test results to learn more about the software and are then creating additional tests based on those results, what type of testing are you doing?</div><div class="opt selectedright">a. A. Exploratory [BAN DA CHON - DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. Decision-based</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Checklist-based</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Control flow</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 4.4.2 Exploratory Testing. Learn - design test - run test là của kỹ thuật nào?</div><h2>Cau hoi 14</h2><div class="qtext">In what way does configuration management help the tester?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. It verifies that the test cases are executed in the correct order [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. It ensures that regressions do not occur</div><div class="opt ">c. C. It enforces proper unit testing and measurement</div><div class="opt correct">d. D. It uniquely identifies the items to be tested [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 5.4 Configuration Management. CM giúp cho tester? theo đúng dấu hiệu trong sách là uniquely identifies</div><h2>Cau hoi 15</h2><div class="qtext">If you are responsible for test analysis and test design what is your primary role in your team?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. Business analyst [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. Test manager</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Developer</div><div class="opt correct">d. D. Tester [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 1.4.5. Roles in Testing. Ai làm task test analysis and design?</div><h2>Cau hoi 16</h2><div class="qtext">A functional requirement states that pressure values must always be positive and stay within a range of 100 to 200 pounds for a particular tank (100 and 200 are valid within the range). Which of the following is the minimum set of values that would achieve coverage using the equivalence partitioning technique?</div><div class="opt selectedright">a. A. A series of tests where pressure is set to 98, 110, and 201 pounds [BAN DA CHON - DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. A series of tests where pressure is set to 98, 100, and 200 pounds</div><div class="opt ">c. C. A series of tests where pressure is set to 100, 110, and 200 pounds</div><div class="opt ">d. D. A series of tests where pressure is set to -1, 0, 175, and 297 pounds</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 4.1 Vẽ phân vùng. Nhớ là valid là từ 100- 200, nhỏ hơn 100 là invalid nên ko cần tách vùng nhỏ hơn 0 nữa. chỉ có 3 phân vùng thôi</div><h2>Cau hoi 17</h2><div class="qtext">You have been given the following test cases for execution. You have been told that security and usability are the highest priorities respectively for this banking application. What is the proper execution order for these test cases? 1. Update a customer’s account balance 2. Query a customer’s account balance 3. Delete a request for a paper statement 4. Change the font size on the page to improve readability 5. Create a new payee in a customer’s automatic bill pay list</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. 3, 1, 5, 2, 4 [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt correct">b. B. 1, 2, 5, 4, 3 [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">c. C. 1, 3, 5, 2, 4</div><div class="opt ">d. D. 4, 3, 1, 2, 5</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Ko hiểu lắm</div><h2>Cau hoi 18</h2><div class="qtext">When is the detailed risk analysis for a story first conducted?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. Project planning [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt correct">b. B. Iteration planning [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Release planning</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Epic planning</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 5.1.2. Tester's Contribution to Iteration and Release Planning. Detailed risk analysis đc thực hiện ở đâu?</div><h2>Cau hoi 19</h2><div class="qtext">Which is a key function of a test management tool?</div><div class="opt selectedright">a. A. Facilitates management and control of testing activities [BAN DA CHON - DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. Generates test data based on test management criteria</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Generates detailed test specifications based on the test plan</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Analyzes and enforces coding and testing standards</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 6.1.Tool Support for Testing. Chức năng chính của management tool? B. C là của tool design và implement D về coding standard là của tool về static testing Chọn A</div><h2>Cau hoi 20</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following best suggests the need for maintenance testing?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. Failures found in alpha testing [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. The initial release of the software</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Changing requirements during pre-deployment activities</div><div class="opt correct">d. D. Adding a new feature to an existing system [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 2.3. Maintenance Testing. Đâu là đề xuất tốt nhất về maintenance test?Chọn D là thêm tính năng mới vào hệ thống đã có. C. Pre-deployment là trước khi release là ko phải của maintain A. alpha test là Acceptance Test ở môi trường của đội dự án -- ko phải maintan B. initial release -- ko phải maintan</div><h2>Cau hoi 21</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following should you review using static testing?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. Memory leak during execution [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. Performance of a module under load</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Interactive output from a debugger</div><div class="opt correct">d. D. Test plan [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer: 3.1.3. Differences between Static Testing and Dynamic Testing. Cái nào sau đây nên sử dụng static testing ( gồm cả review và static analysis by tool)? A, B, C là lỗi của dynamic test Chọn D để thực hiện Review</div><h2>Cau hoi 22</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following is a methodical approach to error guessing?</div><div class="opt selectedright">a. A. Create a list of possible failures and defects and design tests to address each one [BAN DA CHON - DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. Ask the developers where the likely errors will be and discuss how to test for each one</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Review the code to determine areas of high complexity and target those areas with tests</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Determine all the decisions in the code and design tests to address each one</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 4.4.1 Error Guessing . Định nghĩa của error guessing?Chọn A đúng định nghĩa về list of possible defects , failures B. Ask developer - sai C. Review code là của static test D. Decisions in the code là white box</div><h2>Cau hoi 23</h2><div class="qtext">Given the following requirement: The system shall compute the car’s position using the following equation: new_distance_traveled + old_position Which type of testing should be implemented to help ensure this requirement is met?</div><div class="opt selectedright">a. A. Functional [BAN DA CHON - DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. Reliability</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Performance</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Maintainability</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 4.1. Câu này là xác định vị trí của ô tô thì họ cần 2 dữ liệu ew_distance_traveled + old_position đây là test về functional</div><h2>Cau hoi 24</h2><div class="qtext">How is branch coverage determined?</div><div class="opt selectedright">a. A. By taking the number of branches in the code that have been tested and dividing that by the number of total branches in the code [BAN DA CHON - DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. By taking the number of branches in the code on one path that has been tested and dividing that number by the total paths through the code</div><div class="opt ">c. C. By taking the number of statements in the code and dividing those by the number of branches that have been tested</div><div class="opt ">d. D. By counting the number of branches in the code that have been tested</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> refer 4.3.2 Branch testing (Branch coverage),</div><h2>Cau hoi 25</h2><div class="qtext">You are using boundary value analysis to determine your test data. What values should you use to test a routine that requires an integer input (x) to be greater than zero and less than 100 to achieve 100% minimum coverage using the two-point boundary value analysis technique?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. 0, 100 [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. -1, 1, 99, 101</div><div class="opt correct">c. C. 0, 1, 99, 100 [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">d. D. -1, 0, 1, 99, 100, 101</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 4.1. Biến x lớn hơn 0 và nhỏ hơn 100, tìm BVA</div><h2>Cau hoi 26</h2><div class="qtext">You are working with a geographically and time zone distributed team. It is important that the entire team always have access to the latest test execution information. Which of these is the most appropriate method for communicating that status?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. Daily stand-up meetings with everyone [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt correct">b. B. Dashboards connected to the test management and defect management systems that automatically update when a change is made [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Email sent out hourly to all team members with red text for any new issues with a “must read” note in the subject line</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Formal test reports issued each week with trend charts and residual defect status information</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 5.3 Về Communication giữa 2 đội ngồi phân tán về địa lý và thời gian thì làm sao để họ cập nhật đc thông tin mới nhất của nhau thì chỉ có dashboard thôi ( giống như bảng chứng khoán nó update liên tục)</div><h2>Cau hoi 27</h2><div class="qtext">During which activity in the review process are the quality characteristics selected for evaluation?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. Initiating [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt correct">b. B. Planning [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Analysis</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Fixing</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 3.2.2 &amp; 3.2.3 Review Process. Câu hỏi là bước nào trong quy trình mà quality characteristics được select cho việc đánh giá. Chọn Planning</div><h2>Cau hoi 28</h2><div class="qtext">Which testing principle provides a good reason to base testing upon risk mitigation priorities?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. Testing shows the presence of defects [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt correct">b. B. Exhaustive testing is impossible [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Tests wear out</div><div class="opt ">d. D. Defects tend to cluster in a few modules</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 1.3 Seven Principles of Testing. Câu hỏi là nguyên lý nào giải thích tốt cho việc Test dựa vào độ ưu tiên của risk. trả lời là B vì ta ko thể test tất cả đc nên phải test những chỗ có risk cao trước</div><h2>Cau hoi 29</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following is a correct statement regarding Quadrant Q2 of the testing quadrants?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. It is technology facing, supports the team, and contains component and component integration tests [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. It is business facing, critiques the product, and contains exploratory and usability testing</div><div class="opt ">c. C. It is technology facing, critiques the product, and contains the smoke tests and performance tests</div><div class="opt correct">d. D. It is business facing, supports the team, and contains functional tests and API tests [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> refer 5.1.7. Testing Quadrants , nó hỏi về Q2. business facing, support the team</div><h2>Cau hoi 30</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following provides two defined risk response actions to help control product risk?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. Deny risk, Mitigate risk by testing [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. B. Accept risk, Abandon risk</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Abandon risk, Delay risk</div><div class="opt correct">d. D. Transfer risk, Accept risk [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> refer 5.2 Risk Management nó có 4 actions cho risk là Accept, Reduce, Avoid, Tranfer</div><h2>Cau hoi 31</h2><div class="qtext">Your company has been working in a waterfall lifecycle model. They have now decided to implement DevOps and will be using CI/CD. Which of the following is a change that will be required from the testing team?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A. No change is required. The current approach will still be applicable. [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt correct">b. B. There will be additional emphasis on test automation to supply continuous testing. [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">c. C. Additional time will be needed to analyze the requirements and design test cases.</div><div class="opt ">d. D. There will be a need for less technical testers because the developers will handle all the technical testing.</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 2.1.4 Devops. Câu hỏi là dự án đang ở mô hình waterfall, họ muốn đổi sang làm theo Devops và CI/CD thì cần phải thay đổi điều gì. A nó bảo ko phải thay đổi là sai, B nhấm mạnh vào test automation là có trong sách là đúng. C Nó bảo phải thêm thời gian cho phân tích Req và design TC là ko nhắc đến ở sách. D nó bảo cần tester có khả năng về technical ít hơn waterfall là sai nhé vì Devops là tester áp dụng kỹ thuật và tool nhiều hơn</div></body></html>